{"paragraphs":[{"text":"%md\n# Detailed notebook on data handeling of Capstone data.\n### Ref. ‘4.2 Importering og Klargjøring av Data’ in report\nIn this notebook we'll go in details through each step which has been taken to create the complete dataframe which we have used to build our Cassandra enviroment and CQL queries around.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:06:59+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h1>Detailed notebook on data handeling of Capstone data.</h1>\n<h3>Ref. ‘4.2 Importering og Klargjøring av Data’ in report</h3>\n<p>In this notebook we&rsquo;ll go in details through each step which has been taken to create the complete dataframe which we have used to build our Cassandra enviroment and CQL queries around.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762714528079_1297707509","id":"paragraph_1762714528079_1297707509","dateCreated":"2025-11-09T18:55:28+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:06:59+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:06:59+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true},{"text":"%md\n### Import packages and set local time.\n#### Ref. '4.2.1 Overordnet Konfigurering av Zeppelin Notatbok' in report\nSince these files are oriententet around Norwegian timezone, we configure this note book to opreate with the timezone \"Europe/Oslo\". This will make the `TimestampType` give the right time allocation for Timestamp data.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:06:59+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Import packages and set local time.</h3>\n<h4>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.1 Overordnet Konfigurering av Zeppelin Notatbok&rsquo; in report</h4>\n<p>Since these files are oriententet around Norwegian timezone, we configure this note book to opreate with the timezone &ldquo;Europe/Oslo&rdquo;. This will make the <code>TimestampType</code> give the right time allocation for Timestamp data.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762797225883_263168143","id":"paragraph_1762797225883_263168143","dateCreated":"2025-11-10T17:53:45+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:06:59+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:06:59+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%spark\r\nimport spark.implicits._\r\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.types._\r\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.expressions._\r\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions._ \r\n\r\n// Sett timezone to NO\r\nspark.conf.set(\"spark.sql.session.timeZone\", \"Europe/Oslo\")\r\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:06:59+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"editorHide":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"import spark.implicits._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.types._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.expressions._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions._\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762714155530_1600241643","id":"paragraph_1762714155530_1600241643","dateCreated":"2025-11-09T18:49:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:06:59+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:07:02+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n### Define data source locations.\n#### Ref. '4.2.2 Data Kilder' in report\nFirst we'll define the location of the different datasets we're going to import.  \nAll data files used in this project is collected from `.csv` files.  \nThis will be defined with several relative paths. Meaning that that there are different paths to different sources, but their all confined within the `sparkio` local enviroment directory.  \nFile import will be done recursively, so each source path is defined with `*.csv` at the lowest level to include all csv files in the given path.  \n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:07:02+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Define data source locations.</h3>\n<h4>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.2 Data Kilder&rsquo; in report</h4>\n<p>First we&rsquo;ll define the location of the different datasets we&rsquo;re going to import.<br />\nAll data files used in this project is collected from <code>.csv</code> files.<br />\nThis will be defined with several relative paths. Meaning that that there are different paths to different sources, but their all confined within the <code>sparkio</code> local enviroment directory.<br />\nFile import will be done recursively, so each source path is defined with <code>*.csv</code> at the lowest level to include all csv files in the given path.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762797397299_806898811","id":"paragraph_1762797397299_806898811","dateCreated":"2025-11-10T17:56:37+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:07:02+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:07:02+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%spark\nval bil_base = \"/sparkio/trafikkdata/bil/*.csv\"\nval sykkel_base = \"/sparkio/trafikkdata/sykkel/*.csv\"\nval weather_base = \"/sparkio/værdata/*.csv\"","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:07:02+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mbil_base\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32mString\u001b[0m = /sparkio/trafikkdata/bil/*.csv\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34msykkel_base\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32mString\u001b[0m = /sparkio/trafikkdata/sykkel/*.csv\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mweather_base\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32mString\u001b[0m = /sparkio/værdata/*.csv\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762875517429_549992018","id":"paragraph_1762875517429_549992018","dateCreated":"2025-11-11T15:38:37+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:07:03+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:07:03+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n### Build Schema for Dataframes.\n#### Ref. '4.2.3 Schema – Definering av datastruktur' in report\nSince we're importing csv files it's necessary to predifine **Schemas** for the different imports.  \nWe'll create one schmea for trafic related files, since they all have the same data structure.  \nWe'll create a separate schema for weather data.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:07:03+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Build Schema for Dataframes.</h3>\n<h4>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.3 Schema – Definering av datastruktur&rsquo; in report</h4>\n<p>Since we&rsquo;re importing csv files it&rsquo;s necessary to predifine <strong>Schemas</strong> for the different imports.<br />\nWe&rsquo;ll create one schmea for trafic related files, since they all have the same data structure.<br />\nWe&rsquo;ll create a separate schema for weather data.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762875573880_238515049","id":"paragraph_1762875573880_238515049","dateCreated":"2025-11-11T15:39:33+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:07:03+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:07:03+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%spark\nval trafikk_Schema = StructType(Array(\n    StructField(\"trafikkregistreringspunkt\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"navn\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"vegreferanse\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"fra\", TimestampType, true),\n\tStructField(\"til\", TimestampType, true),\n\tStructField(\"dato\", DateType, true),\n\tStructField(\"fra tidspunkt\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"til tidspunkt\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"felt\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"trafikkmengde\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\"dekningsgrad (%)\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"antall timer total\", ByteType, true),\n\tStructField(\"antall timer inkludert\", ByteType, true),\n\tStructField(\"antall timer ugyldig\", ByteType, true),\n\tStructField(\"ikke gyldig lengde\", ByteType, true),\n\tStructField(\"lengdekvalitetsgrad (%)\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"< 5,6m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\">= 5,6m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\"5,6m - 7,6m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\"7,6m - 12,5m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\"12,5m - 16,0m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\">= 16,0m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\"16,0m - 24,0m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\">= 24,0m\", ShortType, true)\n))\n\nval weather_Schema = StructType(Array(\n    StructField(\"navn\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"stasjon\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"tid(norsk normaltid)\", TimestampType, true),\n\tStructField(\"nedbør (1 t)\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"lufttemperatur\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"høyeste middelvind (1 t)\", StringType, true)\n))","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:07:04+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"editorHide":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mtrafikk_Schema\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.types.StructType\u001b[0m = StructType(StructField(trafikkregistreringspunkt,StringType,true),StructField(navn,StringType,true),StructField(vegreferanse,StringType,true),StructField(fra,TimestampType,true),StructField(til,TimestampType,true),StructField(dato,DateType,true),StructField(fra tidspunkt,StringType,true),StructField(til tidspunkt,StringType,true),StructField(felt,StringType,true),StructField(trafikkmengde,ShortType,true),StructField(dekningsgrad (%),StringType,true),StructField(antall timer total,ByteType,true),StructField(antall timer inkludert,ByteType,true),StructField(antall timer ugyldig,ByteType,true),StructField(ikke gyldig lengde,ByteType,true),StructField(lengdekvalitetsgrad (%),StringType,true),StructField(< 5,6m...\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762719376207_1791722203","id":"paragraph_1762719376207_1791722203","dateCreated":"2025-11-09T20:16:16+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:07:04+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:07:04+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n### Importing Data\n#### Ref. '4.2.4 Import av Data' in report","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:07:05+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Importing Data</h3>\n<h4>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.4 Import av Data&rsquo; in report</h4>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762880257361_1153084816","id":"paragraph_1762880257361_1153084816","dateCreated":"2025-11-11T16:57:37+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:07:05+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:07:05+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%spark\nval bil_raw_df = spark.read\n    .option(\"header\", true)\n    .option(\"recursiveFileLookup\", true)\n    .schema(trafikk_Schema)\n    .option(\"delimiter\", \";\")\n    .option(\"nullValue\", \"-\")\n    .option(\"timestampFormat\", \"yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mmXXX\")    \n    .csv(bil_base)\n\nval sykkel_raw_df = spark.read\n    .option(\"header\", true)\n    .option(\"recursiveFileLookup\", true)\n    .schema(trafikk_Schema)\n    .option(\"delimiter\", \";\")\n    .option(\"nullValue\", \"-\")\n    .option(\"timestampFormat\", \"yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mmXXX\")    \n    .csv(sykkel_base)\n\nval weather_raw_df = spark.read\n    .option(\"header\", true)\n    .option(\"recursiveFileLookup\", true)\n    .schema(weather_Schema)\n    .option(\"delimiter\", \";\")\n    .option(\"nullValue\", \"-\")\n    .option(\"timestampFormat\", \"dd.MM.yyyy HH:mm\")\n    .csv(weather_base)\n\nval bil_raw = bil_raw_df.withColumn(\"klasse\", lit(0).cast(ByteType))\nval sykkel_raw = sykkel_raw_df.withColumn(\"klasse\", lit(1).cast(ByteType))","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:07:05+0000","progress":100,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"editorHide":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mbil_raw_df\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [trafikkregistreringspunkt: string, navn: string ... 22 more fields]\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34msykkel_raw_df\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [trafikkregistreringspunkt: string, navn: string ... 22 more fields]\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mweather_raw_df\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [navn: string, stasjon: string ... 4 more fields]\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mbil_raw\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [trafikkregistreringspunkt: string, navn: string ... 23 more fields]\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34msykkel_raw\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [trafikkregistreringspunkt: string, navn: string ... 23 more fields]\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762720776688_657134370","id":"paragraph_1762720776688_657134370","dateCreated":"2025-11-09T20:39:36+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:07:05+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:07:07+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n### Combining Trafic Data\n#### Ref. '4.2.5 Sammensetting av Trafikk Dataframes' in report\nHere we combine the rows of `bil_raw` and `sykkel_raw` into one single dataframe (`trafikk_raw_df`) with the **union** method.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:07:07+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Combining Trafic Data</h3>\n<h4>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.5 Sammensetting av Trafikk Dataframes&rsquo; in report</h4>\n<p>Here we combine the rows of <code>bil_raw</code> and <code>sykkel_raw</code> into one single dataframe (<code>trafikk_raw_df</code>) with the <strong>union</strong> method.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762883365119_2141439142","id":"paragraph_1762883365119_2141439142","dateCreated":"2025-11-11T17:49:25+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:07:07+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:07:07+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%spark\nval trafikk_raw_df = bil_raw.union(sykkel_raw)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:07:07+0000","progress":100,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mtrafikk_raw_df\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.Dataset[org.apache.spark.sql.Row]\u001b[0m = [trafikkregistreringspunkt: string, navn: string ... 23 more fields]\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762791573296_1357469793","id":"paragraph_1762791573296_1357469793","dateCreated":"2025-11-10T16:19:33+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:07:07+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:07:08+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n#### Simple validation of content.\nBelow we're preforming a simple count to validate that the number of rows in new dataframe corresponds with the two separate dataframes.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:07:08+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Simple validation of content.</h4>\n<p>Below we&rsquo;re preforming a simple count to validate that the number of rows in new dataframe corresponds with the two separate dataframes.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762883589529_116530362","id":"paragraph_1762883589529_116530362","dateCreated":"2025-11-11T17:53:09+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:07:08+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:07:08+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%spark\nprint(\"count: bil_df+sykkel_df\\n\")\nprint(bil_raw.count() + sykkel_raw.count())\nprint(\"\\ncount: combined_df\\n\")\nprint(trafikk_raw_df.count())","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:07:08+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"editorHide":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"count: bil_df+sykkel_df\n2124247\ncount: combined_df\n2124247"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=46"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=47"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=48"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=49"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=50"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=51"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762792329300_1133269017","id":"paragraph_1762792329300_1133269017","dateCreated":"2025-11-10T16:32:09+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:07:08+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:07:17+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n### Handle Value Formats\n#### Ref. '4.2.6 Behandling av Importert Data' in report\nWith the use of `withColumn` and `regexp_replace` methods we're correcting the values in need of it and cast is to the corret dataType.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:07:17+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Handle Value Formats</h3>\n<h4>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.6 Behandling av Importert Data&rsquo; in report</h4>\n<p>With the use of <code>withColumn</code> and <code>regexp_replace</code> methods we&rsquo;re correcting the values in need of it and cast is to the corret dataType.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762885219539_1971529294","id":"paragraph_1762885219539_1971529294","dateCreated":"2025-11-11T18:20:19+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:07:17+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:07:17+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%spark\nval trafikk_df_formatFix = trafikk_raw_df\n    .withColumn(\n        \"dekningsgrad (%)\",\n        regexp_replace(col(\"dekningsgrad (%)\"), \",\", \".\").cast(FloatType)\n    )\n    .withColumn(\n        \"lengdekvalitetsgrad (%)\",\n        regexp_replace(col(\"lengdekvalitetsgrad (%)\"), \",\", \".\").cast(FloatType)\n    )\n    .withColumn(\n        \"fra tidspunkt\",\n        date_format(col(\"fra\"), \"k\").cast(\"byte\")\n    )\n    .withColumn(\n        \"til tidspunkt\",\n        date_format(col(\"til\"), \"k\").cast(\"byte\")\n    )\n\nval weather_df_formatfix = weather_raw_df\n    .withColumn(\n        \"nedbør (1 t)\",\n        regexp_replace(col(\"nedbør (1 t)\"), \",\", \".\").cast(FloatType)\n    )\n    .withColumn(\n        \"lufttemperatur\",\n        regexp_replace(col(\"lufttemperatur\"), \",\", \".\").cast(FloatType)\n    )\n    .withColumn(\n        \"høyeste middelvind (1 t)\",\n        regexp_replace(col(\"høyeste middelvind (1 t)\"), \",\", \".\").cast(FloatType)\n    )","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:07:17+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"editorHide":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mtrafikk_df_formatFix\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [trafikkregistreringspunkt: string, navn: string ... 23 more fields]\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mweather_df_formatfix\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [navn: string, stasjon: string ... 4 more fields]\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762795723928_110875404","id":"paragraph_1762795723928_110875404","dateCreated":"2025-11-10T17:28:43+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:07:17+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:07:19+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n### Final join operation to create a Final df\n#### Ref. '4.2.7 Sammensetting av Trafikk og Værdata' in report\nHere we perform the final join operation between trafic and weather data to get a final complete df which will be used to build the Cassandra database.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:07:19+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Final join operation to create a Final df</h3>\n<h4>Ref. &lsquo;4.2.7 Sammensetting av Trafikk og Værdata&rsquo; in report</h4>\n<p>Here we perform the final join operation between trafic and weather data to get a final complete df which will be used to build the Cassandra database.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762893643169_1841534975","id":"paragraph_1762893643169_1841534975","dateCreated":"2025-11-11T20:40:43+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:07:19+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:07:19+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%spark\nval complete_df = trafikk_df_formatFix.alias(\"c\")\n    .join(weather_df_formatfix.alias(\"w\"),\n        col(\"c.fra\") === col(\"w.tid(norsk normaltid)\"),\"left\")\n    .select(\n        col(\"c.*\"),\n        col(\"w.lufttemperatur\"),\n        col(\"w.høyeste middelvind (1 t)\").as(\"høyeste middelvind (m/s)\")\n    )","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:07:19+0000","progress":100,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mcomplete_df\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [trafikkregistreringspunkt: string, navn: string ... 25 more fields]\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762892671307_806442058","id":"paragraph_1762892671307_806442058","dateCreated":"2025-11-11T20:24:31+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T21:07:19+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T21:07:20+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n## Preview of Final df.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T21:07:20+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>Preview of Final df.</h2>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762893972210_1661360495","id":"paragraph_1762893972210_1661360495",